{"id":899,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为帮助考研达线学生精准把握复试要点、科学规划调剂方向，切实提升备考效率与应试能力，3月17日16:00，化学与化工学院在17101H教室召开2026年研究生复试调剂指导交流会。学院党委副书记蔡文涛，副院长胡志勇、赵慧鹏，辅导员成娟及学院2026届考研达线学生参加本次会议，会议由成娟主持。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rnl7IDU8-ZUz9PU54A2M7n7LRNaM4NCDLlL8LRAkLRT7nzl0gihFp2hmCIa0UYysn1ybLkybMzl8M8lDnNM7nlCDoRCbU8lYUlr7M8lsLRfFLmv8UNlPUNVFMR78nmCJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiLmUPgtA8pUQcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45241&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C7F9095547E6FCDEF6869CE2AED7E700/274BE1BA/414F6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 550px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=roRTI7MmARLmQfo5RGYLl7PLzT2LRnCRM4GZnzrknz6VLz70gihFp2hmCIa0MkhRLSyDU1yYMm7ZUNnkoznfLlCiozLYUzGinmGPoRffLzrFU478M4lsL8WFLm6VnmLYgtXaQ4Oeo4xw_26m_IX4gDTJQty0LzG8L1y8Mz-8LSbw62Q8c&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45241&e=.jpg\"></p><p>会上，蔡文涛副书记作复试动员讲话，他充分肯定了同学们在考研初试中付出的努力与取得的成绩，同时为同学们加油鼓劲，叮嘱大家调整备考心态、坚定升学信心，以从容的状态迎接复试挑战，为后续备考指明了方向。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rnzNI8oRUYn77an5zWRLRTkn7LDL7MCRU4NPn7WfLzNPMl-0gihFp2hmCIa0UShRLYyYMYhVUzUZUNnkMznkoRnkM4AVL8CZLRNiMNC4LmWFozTRnml8nznFL4U4LlCJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiLmUPgtA8pUQcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45241&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/AC327EA48BDB54B84B78E3F80956F322/99CF54E4/3431F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 400px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rU4NI4L8C4oRU4U5NUiLzCaUzTRMRVC7UlrfLmT7LlVVnRl0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyZLkhfokysn7MkMRLZo7QRL4-YM8VkM4nfU8LZM4-so7VFLmCZUNrVLRAFUmvDo7UJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiLmUPgtA8pUQcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45241&e=.jpg\"></p><p>赵慧鹏副院长结合化学与化工学科特色，从复试流程拆解、面试技巧分享、调剂政策解读及信息获取策略等方面展开专业辅导，内容覆盖专业知识考查、科研潜力展现等复试核心要点，为同学们理清了备考思路，明确了调剂方向。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rL4CIsLRV7LmL4L54-8nRLZL4TkozMCkUm7YUmLbnRffUl-0gihFp2hmCIa0U1ybMkyioSyDnN-8nmT7M7lPnz67L4GsUmliUm-ZLlU8MNQFUmUiLN-bUlMFMllZolUJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiLmUPgtA8pUQcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45241&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B94596FB4F9D4E1E7D307B55B281D46F/B452B9AC/5E89D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 400px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rM8CIinmvanlUYL5NUZo7LaLzL8ozCCZozC4M7LYUmviLRC0gihFp2hmCIa0nShfLYh7LYyiLlQkL7nfU4VfnlV2nlCPMN7YL8lYL8-YUNMFnRTVozQ2L8VFLm6VnzCYgtXaQ4Oeo4xw_26m_IX4gDTJQty0LzG8L1y8Mz-8LSbw62Q8c&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45241&e=.jpg\"></p><p>胡志勇副院长依托多年教学与研究生管理经验，作复试备考经验分享与重点提示，对复试关键环节进行细化指导，并从备考细节、应试注意事项等方面提出切实建议，其独到的见解和实用的方法为同学们复试备考提供了重要参考。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rnlVIVMmUsMzCbn5zQRnR6VU4lYMRGCYnRUaLNWknRUDU4G0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky4LYy8n1yZM8l4UlVRUzGYLlnfLzNbLmliUz6kL7MRUzMFoz7Yn7lsM7rFMlQVU4UJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiLmUPgtA8pUQcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45241&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4334F87E3AACA021DA199255A7B0CCA3/912DE74E/5FEC4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 400px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rMznI7LlC4UzvZM5z7PM4MkLmTRUl7CPLlLaozA7Mm9PMm90gihFp2hmCIa0MSyiLkhfUYyanl-YM4C4LRV7U8rRL7lYL7lPMz7iLm7ioRMFLmM7M47inlQFoR74U8L4gtXaQ4Oeo4xw_26m_IX4gDTJQty0LzG8L1y8Mz-8LSbw62Q8c&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45241&e=.jpg\"></p><p>在互动答疑环节，同学们围绕复试细节、院校选择、调剂流程等实际问题踊跃提问，与会领导与教师逐一耐心解答，有针对性地为同学们扫清备考疑惑，现场交流氛围热烈。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rMNrI2oRMkLRv8M5mNin7C8Mm-PM7WCRnml8MNlsoRn7MR90gihFp2hmCIa0n1h7n1yZUSybnllPolC8U87PoRCsMllsozvYMz-ZnlWVLzAFLRnRnRlsLR6FL8rRoR7Jqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiLmUPgtA8pUQcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45241&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FDF8A9EE19F4CA18675E7972528EBE18/04CD5707/3EC81\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 400px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rolUIPnNn7UzW7L5mMfL47ioR-bo7QC7U4LDozCZnz-8Lz70gihFp2hmCIa0LkyaU1hkL1hRnmWVo7WfU4N8ozvZLm7sL7rkUl-YU8WVUzAFolV7U8LsLzfFLzUsLzffgtXaQ4Oeo4xw_26m_IX4gDTJQty0LzG8L1y8Mz-8LSbw62Q8c&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45241&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次指导交流会内容详实、针对性强，既有宏观的备考方向指引，又有微观的应试细节把控，有效帮助同学们明晰了复试与调剂的备考重点，缓解了备考焦虑。学院将持续为考研学生提供全方位的支持与服务，做同学们研途冲刺的坚实后盾，祝愿全体考研达线学生在复试中发挥最佳水平，顺利圆梦理想学府。</p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hgxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rnl7IDU8-ZUz9PU54A2M7n7LRNaM4NCDLlL8LRAkLRT7nzl0gihFp2hmCIa0UYysn1ybLkybMzl8M8lDnNM7nlCDoRCbU8lYUlr7M8lsLRfFLmv8UNlPUNVFMR78nmCJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg4UiLmUPgtA8pUQcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=45241&e=.jpg"}